000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-UPDATE.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT MASTER-FILE ASSIGN TO "MASTER.DAT"
000700     ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000800     SELECT AUDIT-FILE ASSIGN TO "AUDIT.LOG"
000900     ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
001000 DATA DIVISION.
001100 FILE SECTION.
001200 FD MASTER-FILE.
001300 01 MASTER-RECORD.
001400    05 M-ACC-NUM          PIC X(10).
001500    05 M-BALANCE          PIC 9(7)V99.
001600    05 M-RATE             PIC 9(2)V999.
001700 FD AUDIT-FILE.
001800 01 AUDIT-RECORD          PIC X(100).
001900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002000 01 WS-SYSTEM-FLAGS.
002100    05 WS-EOF             PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
002200    05 WS-CALC-STATUS     PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.
002300 01 WS-TEMP-VARIABLES.
002400    05 WS-TOTAL-INTEREST  PIC 9(7)V99.
002500    05 WS-FEE-AMOUNT      PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 15.00.
002600 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002700 0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
002800     OPEN INPUT MASTER-FILE
002900     OPEN OUTPUT AUDIT-FILE
003000     PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE-PROCESS
003100     PERFORM 2000-READ-AND-PROCESS UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
003200     PERFORM 9000-FINALIZE-JOB
003300     CLOSE MASTER-FILE
003400     CLOSE AUDIT-FILE
003500     STOP RUN.
003600 1000-INITIALIZE-PROCESS.
003700     DISPLAY "ACCOUNT UPDATE PROCESSOR INITIATING...".
003800     MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF.
003900     CALL "DB-INTERFACE" USING WS-SYSTEM-FLAGS.
004000 2000-READ-AND-PROCESS.
004100     READ MASTER-FILE
004200        AT END
004300           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
004400        NOT AT END
004500           PERFORM 3000-UPDATE-ACCOUNT
004600     END-READ.
004700 3000-UPDATE-ACCOUNT.
004800     IF M-BALANCE > 50000.00
004900        PERFORM 4000-PROCESS-PREMIUM
005000     ELSE
005100        PERFORM 5000-PROCESS-STANDARD
005200     END-IF.
005300     CALL "MORTGAGE-CALC" USING MASTER-RECORD, WS-TOTAL-INTEREST, WS-CALC-STATUS.
005400     IF WS-CALC-STATUS = '00'
005500        MOVE WS-TOTAL-INTEREST TO M-BALANCE
005600     ELSE
005700        DISPLAY "CALCULATION ERROR DETECTED: " WS-CALC-STATUS
005800     END-IF.
005900 4000-PROCESS-PREMIUM.
006000     DISPLAY "PROCESSING PREMIUM CLIENT FOR ACC: " M-ACC-NUM.
006100     COMPUTE M-BALANCE = M-BALANCE - WS-FEE-AMOUNT * 0.5.
006200 5000-PROCESS-STANDARD.
006300     COMPUTE M-BALANCE = M-BALANCE - WS-FEE-AMOUNT.
006400 9000-FINALIZE-JOB.
006500     DISPLAY "ACCOUNT UPDATE JOB COMPLETE.".
